title: Door3BInside
---
// Talk target just inside 3B's door (Hotspots layer).
-> Go out <<if is_done("R1MoveIn", "keys") and not is_done("R1Dinner2", "wait") and not is_done("R1Dinner2Retry", "wait") and not in_box("R1Knock") and not in_box("R1Notebook")>>
    <<open_door Door3B>>
    <<walk Player PlayerOutOf3B>>
    <<close_door Door3B>>
-> Answer the door <<if can("R1MoveIn", "rules")>>
    <<next_scene Route1MoveInRules>>
-> Answer the door <<if can("R1Knock", "open")>>
    <<next_scene Route1KnockOpen>>
-> Answer the door <<if can("R1Notebook", "ask")>>
    <<next_scene Route1NotebookAsk>>
-> Go to work <<if can("R1Knock", "on")>>
    <<note_done r1_knock>>
    <<done R1Knock on>>
    <<next_scene Route1NotebookStart>>
-> Look
    <<if in_box("R1Viewing")>>
        {$samantha_name}: That's the way out. When you've seen enough, tell me.
    <<elseif can("R1Knock", "on")>>
        You: Work. Then home.
    <<elseif in_box("R1Notebook")>>
        You: My door. She has a key to it.
    <<elseif is_done("R1Dinner2", "wait") or is_done("R1Dinner2Retry", "wait")>>
        You: It's late. I'm not going anywhere.
    <<else>>
        You: My door. From the inside it feels more like mine.
    <<endif>>
===
